; STATISTICAL COMPENSATOR, the Hazard's rank-II weapon mod (SP3 Task 2, design ruling 11). SP 2,
; UNIQUE (system_tags 1), LIMITED 3 (charges_max). Fits Rifle (3), Cannon (1), Launcher (4), CQB (0),
; Nexus (5), Melee (2) - the card's order - at Main (1), Heavy (2), Superheavy (3). No added_tags: the
; +2 is optional and charged, so it is the applied buff, armed per attack by the prompt. SP5: the icon.
[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_compensator"]
script = ExtResource("4_weaponmod")
allowed_sizes = Array[int]([1, 2, 3])
allowed_types = Array[int]([3, 1, 4, 0, 5, 2])
applied_buffs = Array[ExtResource("5_buff")]([ExtResource("7_reliable")])

